#==============================================================================================
#
#   url - Fetch's URL scheme predicates
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Infrastructure/URL.h (lines 23-50) and URL.cpp
#       (lines 18-112): the HTTP(S) scheme test MIME sniffing needs (MimeSniff/Resource.cpp),
#       local URLs and fetch schemes, which navigation needs (region r28: policy containers in
#       history, attempting to create a non-fetch scheme document), and the data: URL
#       processor (region p2a). DataURL is FetchDataUrl (types_url).
